\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form."] [:db/add "3f1cf992-cea1-53fd-b5c6-12db94048803" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}8 & 72 & 72 & -64 \\\\ -9 & -81 & -81 & 72 \\\\ -4 & -36 & -36 & 32\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nTransforming $M$ to reduced row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\nR_1:=(\\frac{1}{8})R_1\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nM\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 9 & 9 & -8 \\\\ -9 & -81 & -81 & 72 \\\\ -4 & -36 & -36 & 32\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nR_2:=R_2+(9)R_1\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nM\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 9 & 9 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -4 & -36 & -36 & 32\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nR_3:=R_3+(4)R_1\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nM\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 9 & 9 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\n"] [:db/add "3f1cf992-cea1-53fd-b5c6-12db94048803" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "3f1cf992-cea1-53fd-b5c6-12db94048803" :question/answer-fields "c9b656fa-0739-5899-b386-4ee86ce8d856"] [:db/ensure "3f1cf992-cea1-53fd-b5c6-12db94048803" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096746 :knowledge-point/questions "3f1cf992-cea1-53fd-b5c6-12db94048803"] [:db/add "b83c29bb-32fe-58b9-a7e5-3e00d0c61e1f" :answer/id #uuid "b83c29bb-32fe-58b9-a7e5-3e00d0c61e1f"] [:db/add "b83c29bb-32fe-58b9-a7e5-3e00d0c61e1f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b83c29bb-32fe-58b9-a7e5-3e00d0c61e1f" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -6 & -7 & -12 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}"] [:db/ensure "b83c29bb-32fe-58b9-a7e5-3e00d0c61e1f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "dda8cb79-6854-56b6-b7f8-88b25ee7df10" :answer/id #uuid "dda8cb79-6854-56b6-b7f8-88b25ee7df10"] [:db/add "dda8cb79-6854-56b6-b7f8-88b25ee7df10" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "dda8cb79-6854-56b6-b7f8-88b25ee7df10" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -7 & -7 & -12 \\\