ned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form."] [:db/add "d8bde274-b548-57da-a7aa-f0d5c5d05c1a" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}7 & 7 & -56 & -35 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -8 & -5 \\\\ 10 & 10 & -80 & -50\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nTransforming $M$ to reduced row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\nR_1\\leftrightarrow R_2\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nM\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & -8 & -5 \\\\ 7 & 7 & -56 & -35 \\\\ 10 & 10 & -80 & -50\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nR_2:=R_2+(-7)R_1\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nM\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & -8 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 10 & 10 & -80 & -50\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nR_3:=R_3+(-10)R_1\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nM\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & -8 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\n"] [:db/add "d8bde274-b548-57da-a7aa-f0d5c5d05c1a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "d8bde274-b548-57da-a7aa-f0d5c5d05c1a" :question/answer-fields "867bf869-b5e9-5393-8045-b10b47688dc1"] [:db/ensure "d8bde274-b548-57da-a7aa-f0d5c5d05c1a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096746 :knowledge-point/questions "d8bde274-b548-57da-a7aa-f0d5c5d05c1a"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "f1e17da9-fe07-5bc7-a21d-6c064f830a05"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/83/83222faa6f026357e272d171a56aa6517404a6413847f68d084367d47b9f3cdd/generator.py"] [:db/add 17592186096746 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186096746 :knowledge-point/validate]]
